The directed model, incidence predictor and complex whitening have been
adapted to sheaf-mpnn's modules and configuration system. Sparse global
operator assembly is replaced with node-to-edge-to-node message passing.
Low-rank and FastH variants are library extensions. See docs/dhsnn.md for
the tested scope and remaining experimental-protocol differences.

The reference orthogonal parameterization credits Twitter, Inc. (2022),
Apache-2.0. Native orthogonal kernels in this library retain their own notices.
